WEBVTT

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:33.690
Today is a fun, fun Sunday!

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:36.740
Let's make our lunches!

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:39.480
Let's make rolled omelets!

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:40.240
Let's!

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:43.370
Mix the eggs all up!

00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:46.870
Mix, mix, mix, mix, mix 'em all up!

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:50.070
Spread the oil over the pan!

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:53.300
Make sure to get the corners, too!

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:57.060
When the pan is good and 
hot, in go the eggs!

00:01:57.060 --> 00:02:00.680
From back to front, roll, roll, roll!

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.470
Roll, roll, roll!

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:06.010
Spread a little more oil around!

00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:07.260
And then? And then?

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:10.780
Pour in a little more egg and...

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:14.580
From back to front, roll, roll, roll!

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:16.260
Roll, roll, roll!

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:20.160
It's done!

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:26.160
<b>Sakura, Rainbows, and Grandpa</b>

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:29.820
It looks so good!

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:32.260
I hope it tastes just as good.

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:35.610
It'll be fine! You worked really hard on it.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:37.080
The kid'll be thrilled!

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:39.450
Looks like the weather's gonna be nice, too.

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:40.890
Perfect date weather!

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:42.770
D-Date?!

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:43.930
It is a date, ain't it?

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.650
Well, um... I...

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:49.390
It ain't nothin' but a date.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:51.840
It's two of you goin' out together!

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:53.770
<b>Oh!</b>

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:57.410
Th-There's some for you and Yukito-san, too!

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.960
I divided them between the 
two layers of the box.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.980
Yay! Thanks!

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:05.100
Make sure you help out 
at Yukito-san's house.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.830
Sure! Leave it to me!

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:10.960
Can I really count on you to 
help him with the cleaning?

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:11.360
Huh?

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:13.140
What's that mean?

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:15.590
Don't just play around and get in the way.

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:17.100
I-I won't!

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:21.710
Besides, no Creature of the Seal is 
better suited to cleanin' than me!

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:27.100
I don't know any other Creatures 
of the Seal, so I wouldn't know.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.420
Oh, right!

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:35.810
It's ready!

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:39.000
Nice work, Sakura! Right on time, too!

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.930
Thanks for helping me.

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:43.660
Coming!

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:51.030
No snitching bites!

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:57.720
I-I'm sorry! Kinomoto residence!

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.360
<i>Was someone trying to sneak bites?</i>

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:02.850
No, um...

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:04.920
Is this Sonomi-san?

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:08.030
Yes, hello. Is this a good time?

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:09.820
<i>Yes, it's fine!</i>

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:15.050
The thing is, I got an 
unexpected call today...

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:19.260
Tiptoe, tiptoe, tiptoe...

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:21.350
Today?

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:25.420
Your grandpa?

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:29.870
<i>He's my mom's grandpa, so 
he's my great-grandpa.</i>

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:33.950
Tomoyo-chan's mom called to tell me that

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:36.880
there's something he 
wants to give me, today.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.440
Today?

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:41.260
<i>Tomorrow, he has to leave the country,</i>

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:44.900
<i>and it'll be months before he comes back.</i>

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:46.310
I see...

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:48.860
<i>And we had our own plans for today...</i>

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:52.920
I'm sorry.

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:56.330
No, this is more important. 
Don't worry about it.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.710
<i>I really am sorry.</i>

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:03.440
Huh?

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.450
<b>Tomoyo-chan 
sent you a message.</b>

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:05.440
From Tomoyo-chan...

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:06.450
<b>New Message 
From: Tomoyo Daidouji</b>

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:07.870
I have a message from Daidouji, too.

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:11.860
Huh?

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:20.540
It sure is big.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:21.870
Yeah.

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:24.350
You're sure this is the right place?

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:25.660
Yeah.

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:29.390
I wonder where the buzzer is...

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:33.470
Pardon us.

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:35.840
Sakura Kinomoto-san, correct?

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:37.070
Y-Yes!

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:39.150
We've been waiting for you.

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:45.290
This way, please.

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:56.130
You seem like you're used 
to this, Syaoran-kun.

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:57.570
No, not really.

00:05:57.570 --> 00:05:58.530
You really do!

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:02.090
Oh, that's right. You have 
a butler, don't you?

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.590
No, Wei is more like a family member.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:27.270
Hello!

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:31.670
Well, hello. Sorry to ask you 
to come on such short notice.

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:36.490
Not at all. Are you sure you're not too 
busy preparing for your trip overseas?

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:39.880
Well, there's something I simply 
had to pass along to you.

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:41.080
To me?

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:44.210
But first, why don't you introduce me?

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:45.520
Oh, yeah!

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.420
This is Syaoran Li-kun.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.070
He goes to my middle school.

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:54.910
We're in the same grade, but his 
class is next door, and he's my...

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:57.760
My...

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:03.520
I'm Syaoran Li. Thank 
you for the invitation.

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:09.830
Li-kun, eh? Sorry I made you 
change your plans, today.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:11.950
Think nothing of it.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:14.880
I heard you had planned to go out together.

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:16.820
Yes, which is why...

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.270
You made all this?

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:22.980
Yes!

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:25.220
It looks delicious!

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:28.730
But didn't you two intend 
to eat them together?

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:31.290
It'll taste better if we all share it.

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:33.300
Have some of this, too, if you'd like.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:37.270
Ah, this looks wonderful, too!

00:07:37.780 --> 00:07:40.550
Syaoran-kun is a really good cook!

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:42.210
No, I'm not really...

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:43.010
You are!

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:46.050
No, your lunches look better.

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:49.410
That's not true! Your sweets look better!

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:50.250
No, yours!

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:51.470
No, yours!

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:54.900
That just means they both must be delicious.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:59.530
Since you two have recommended both,

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:01.780
let's start eating right away.

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.950
This tea is delicious.

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:11.900
I bought it during my last business trip.

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:14.710
I thought you might like it.

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:16.210
Thank you!

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:22.090
I wonder if Sakura-chan and Li-kun 
have met your grandfather by now.

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:23.550
I would guess so.

00:08:23.550 --> 00:08:26.820
He really did this out of the blue.

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:30.290
He said there was something 
he wanted to give her, right?

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:31.070
Yes.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:33.990
But why did he invite Li-kun, too?

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:39.090
Well, those two are close enough that 
they had plans to go out together.

00:08:39.090 --> 00:08:41.370
I'm sure he wants to see 
what kind of boy he is.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:43.530
That makes sense.

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:48.590
But I'm sure Li-kun will live up 
to Grandfather Masaki's standards.

00:08:51.150 --> 00:08:54.450
Thank you for bringing all 
this. It truly was delicious.

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:01.970
Oh, dear...

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.200
I'll go get some more!

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:06.900
You're sure you don't mind?

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:07.710
Sure!

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.430
So...

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:11.850
That's where I need to go, right?

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:16.080
Yes. Just talk to the people you see inside.

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:20.050
Tell them we need some fresh tea.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:21.200
Okay.

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:23.330
Be right back.

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:40.790
It's a bit nerve-racking when it's 
just the two of us, isn't it?

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:42.600
I-I'm sorry...

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.320
No, I should apologize.

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:48.550
Would you mind having a little chat with me?

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:50.580
If you don't mind talking to me.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:51.960
Thank you.

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:56.010
What is Sakura-chan like in school?

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:57.120
Very energetic.

00:09:57.470 --> 00:10:00.570
She's always smiling and always having fun.

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:04.020
Just watching her makes everyone else happy.

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:06.830
I see...

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:15.790
Her mother was just the same, at that age.

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:20.610
Grandfather! Grandfather!

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:22.840
Look, a rainbow!

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:27.840
She was always smiling 
and always having fun.

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:32.530
Just watching her made everyone else happy.

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:38.390
She didn't have Sakura-chan's 
athletic ability, though.

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:44.360
Nadeshiko!

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:45.990
Are you all right?

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:46.990
Yes.

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:50.060
See? I didn't crush the flower.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:57.160
She was such a kind child.

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:07.370
But I made that kind child very sad.

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:13.300
Because of my pride,

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:18.680
I couldn't celebrate with her at 
the most joyous time of her life.

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:22.750
She passed away before I could apologize.

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:30.020
But I was able to meet Sakura-chan.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:36.830
Through Sakura-chan, I felt 
as if I got to see her again.

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:40.760
I even had a chance to talk 
to the man who loved her,

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.760
the man she got to spend 
so little time with.

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:49.210
Since I don't know the full story, maybe 
it's not my place to say anything,

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:53.160
but I think your granddaughter 
is happy about that, too.

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:56.390
I hope so.

00:11:56.810 --> 00:11:57.780
I'm sure of it.

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:06.620
Both Nadeshiko and Sakura-chan...

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:13.890
Why can I not despise the men who come 
to take such adorable girls away?

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:17.220
I'm sorry, what was that?

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:22.270
I said things never turn 
out the way you'd expect.

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:29.220
So good!

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:33.130
Do you have work today?

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:36.600
I'm off today. Toya is 
being the monster for me.

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:37.860
<b>Action Show</b>

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.930
He sure is a hard worker.

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:42.530
He said he wants to pay 
his tuition on his own.

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:48.920
Also, if Sakura-chan goes to college or 
wants to do something else, he wants to help.

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:51.640
He's such a good big brother.

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:53.660
Got a mean mouth on him, though.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.780
Well, he's a hardcore 
sister-complex case, after all.

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:01.310
Great meal.

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:11.310
I know there's nothing I can do myself,

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:15.380
but I can work hard for Sakura-chan 
and the rest of you.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:18.960
Tell that to the other me, okay?

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:20.280
Sure.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:36.070
Wait, I don't even need to 
say it. You heard him, Yue.

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:37.390
Yes.

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:40.270
Toya's powers are coming back, right?

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:42.160
That's what he said.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:43.390
And...

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:59.370
There's no way it's unrelated to Sakura's 
powers gettin' ridiculously strong.

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:02.080
Any word from England?

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:03.830
No, but...

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:06.880
I got this.

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:08.870
I see.

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:32.020
Excuse me...

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:36.570
Excuse me...

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:40.830
Can someone get us some tea?

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:12.070
Am I even allowed to come up here?

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:46.920
This is...

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:52.940
I know what this is.

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:03.200
It was my mom's room.

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:42.240
<i>Release!</i>

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:49.240
<i>Show me the memories of this room's past!</i>

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:53.410
<i>Record!</i>

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:13.850
Mom...

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:17.920
No more.

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:18.560
Huh?

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:30.120
Any further, and you 
won't be able to return.

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:57.960
I'm in that dream again...

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:06.030
I know who that is.

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:23.250
I know you!

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.400
I know who you are!

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:29.230
I know you...

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:31.140
Sakura!

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:37.940
I-I'm sorry...

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:41.670
What happened? Do you feel ill?

00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:45.720
No, it's not that.

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:48.070
I heard the sound of a clock.

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:49.910
Then everything got dark...

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:56.310
And someone was standing in 
the darkness, wearing a robe.

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:58.600
That robe...

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:03.600
Yes... It was the formal attire that's 
been passed down in our family.

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:06.500
It was my robe.

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:12.350
You should go to sleep for the night.

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:13.420
But...

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:16.140
Uh...

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:26.850
Um...

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:29.280
Don't worry.

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:31.210
I'll stay by your side.

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:33.540
So...

00:20:36.930 --> 00:20:38.320
Goodnight.

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:44.300
Sakura-chan, are you all right?

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:46.780
I... Why...

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:48.800
You were taking a long time,

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:51.150
so Li-kun and I came to look for you.

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:53.680
Call a doctor.

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:55.050
Right away!

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:56.190
I'm all right.

00:20:56.510 --> 00:20:58.650
I just got a little dizzy.

00:20:58.650 --> 00:20:59.740
But...

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:01.770
Really, I'm okay.

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:03.970
I'm okay.

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:16.480
She's begun to synchronize.

00:21:16.840 --> 00:21:20.720
Yes, she must have had the same 
dream as the cards' maker.

00:21:21.110 --> 00:21:22.690
And the content of the book?

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:23.970
It's progressing.

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:27.740
The power of the dream is growing,

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:30.320
but isn't it a bit sooner than expected?

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:32.460
The sooner, the better.

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:34.080
But...

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:37.010
Her protectors have noticed,

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:39.490
and they've begun to move.

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:54.660
It's good to see you again, Cerberus, Yue.

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:58.090
Yeah, you wouldn't respond, 
so we had to come.

00:21:58.090 --> 00:21:59.240
True.

00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:01.790
We might not look it, but we're 
really ticked off, you know!

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:05.040
I know.

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:07.840
It's plain by the look on Yue's face.

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:12.040
Since you sent that image of the 
magic circle to summon us...

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:14.670
Does that mean you are 
prepared to talk to us?

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:15.990
Yes.

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:18.500
Then explain everything.

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:21.550
Tell us what is happening to our master.

00:22:26.130 --> 00:22:28.530
The one thing I had feared the most

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:30.500
is becoming reality.

00:24:10.060 --> 00:24:12.230
Hidey-howdy-ho!

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:12.970
<b>Leave It to Kero-chan!</b>

00:24:12.910 --> 00:24:16.950
I've really gotten used to sayin' this 
line. Time for "Leave It to Kero-chan!"

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:20.480
<b>Bear      Cat</b>

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:20.480
<b>K</b>

00:24:16.950 --> 00:24:20.470
Today, I'm introducin' the lunches and 
sweets they ate at Great-Grandpa's villa!

00:24:20.470 --> 00:24:23.030
First is the same lunch 
Yukibunny and I ate.

00:24:23.030 --> 00:24:24.990
Sakura's been practicin', so the 
rolled omelets are perfect.

00:24:24.990 --> 00:24:27.120
Then there's fried chicken, mince 
cutlets, stir-fried veggies...

00:24:27.120 --> 00:24:28.930
She gave a lot of thought to 
the nutritional balance!

00:24:28.930 --> 00:24:31.240
As for the kid's sweets, I'd be 
glad to eat some, next time...

00:24:30.240 --> 00:24:31.240
<b>I'm hungry!</b>

00:24:31.240 --> 00:24:33.310
I haven't seen Grandpa in 
ages, but he seems well!

00:24:31.240 --> 00:24:37.240
<b>Bear      Cat</b>

00:24:31.240 --> 00:24:37.240
<b>K</b>

